caption: Default Mastery Shape
engine-rule: default-mastery-shape

A completed Word Tradition defines objective Mastery requirements appropriate to its own grammar. Word Mastery has no separate 100/300-point investment floor. Every Word, element, or equivalent purchasable syntactic skill in the Tradition's complete Mastery lexicon must be at effective 16+ at Tier 2 or effective 20+ at Tier 3, unless the explicit skill-cap exception in Section 5.6 requires the lower effective cap. A non-skill Word does not acquire a new skill from this requirement; complete any actual Word or category purchases required by the Tradition. The benchmark should also include:

- Completion of the Tradition's required Word, lexicon, skill, technique, or comparable syntactic advancement structure, without an additional standardized character-point floor.
